{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"4153","name":"深泥奇谭","desc":"2.7版本活动 深泥奇谭","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/06/22/4521515/7e7a159eb7e90f0b28e52d3bf4d96614_5768405079195947609.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"深泥奇谭","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/06/22/4521515/c7eaecffa7c30804424dba59559dc7fd_5734928612982693198.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1311","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e活动期间，前往层岩巨渊，帮助须弥学者处理黑泥爆发的危机，清理矿道。完成指定任务可获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e原石、大英雄的经验、天赋培养素材、精锻用魔矿\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e等奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e2022/06/22 10:00 ~ 2022/07/04 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥28级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e完成世界任务「巧瞒七星解磐键」解锁层岩巨渊·地下矿区\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e且在世界任务「方入巨渊初探勘」中获取流明石触媒，并强化等级达到2级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e● 活动开始的第一天起，每天都会解锁相应的任务。新解锁的任务需完成前一天的任务后才能接取。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e● 清理矿道时，矿道周围会涌出危险的「黑泥」，黑泥将给附近的怪物带来持续的增幅，使其攻击力与防御力大幅提升。当怪物处于黑泥覆盖的区域中时，得到的增幅会进一步提升。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e● 怪物会持续不断的对清理工作进行干扰，同时清理区域周围也会不断涌现黑泥。装备流明石触媒，使用「纯光绽放」清除黑泥可以弱化怪物，推进清理工作进程。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e● 随着清理工作逐渐深入，黑泥清理难度也逐渐提升，\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(190,26,29,1)\\\"\u003e旅行者可在层岩巨渊·地下矿区搜寻更多的流明晶石，强化流明石触媒至更高等级\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1312","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动流程","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动NPC-璃月【凯瑟琳】-胡赛尼\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e首日关卡：运行测试\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/06/22/4521515/97d972ece4a1e159acd630cdf753fe64_403490915307594574.jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:648px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e关卡玩法\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/06/22/4521515/6e12596828e832890702fc8b6efbe0ce_9052129229227098541.jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:648px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/06/22/4521515/712178ce98fea9ca6faf15971417efaf_4905205931482490751.jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:648px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e完成本日活动奖励：\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-type=\\\"obc-content\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e原石\u003c/a\u003e×80，\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5565/detail?bbs_presentation_sty